{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices to navigate both existential\u00a0dread and a budding relationship while you\u00a0date a  mushroom girl that only lives for 3 days. Eat her at the end - or see what happens when you refuse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to MeetnEat\u2122</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Our fungal experts have finally created mushrooms girls! Eat them, love them, hurt yourself with them - It's all up to you, dear consumer!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;With a lifespan of only 3 days, they'll conveniently dry up and die before the nagging wears you down.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766830/extras/df61927ba815991880c33336cb792a54.webp?t=1773264662\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766830/extras/df61927ba815991880c33336cb792a54.poster.webp?t=1773264662\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=231 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mushroom Girls in Stock:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow <strong>Button</strong>, an upbeat and playful mushroom who is perfectly fine with you eating her!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or <strong>Alice</strong>, our toxic mushroom designed to  prioritise your satisfaction, no matter what.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or <strong>Sai</strong>, a psychedelic mushroom who we added PURELY FOR RESEARCH PURPOSES.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features (~8 hours of gameplay)</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go on dates and fall in love with mushroom girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook them into delicious dishes, like omelettes and smores.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand holding, kissing, snuggling, and literally sleeping with them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide or neglect them through their existential crises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal or deteriorate your own mental health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spray them every day so they stay nice and moist!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camping, friend-zoning, imprisonment, emotional manipulation, and much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766830/extras/084ffcd9dec663199bd313c8feb0c266.avif?t=1773264662\" width=616 height=231 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3 Mushrooms. 22 Endings.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your mushroom's mental health and affection carefully. All characters have their own personalities and unique struggles - including you! Make your story as horrific or as heart-warming as you desire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766830/extras/4801ff55a41ddfc7c56706db2adb0677.avif?t=1773264662\" width=88 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is not suitable for children or those who are easily disturbed. Please check the content warnings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3766830?t=1773264662","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766830/648487a6941b74dd1295f7dba73fffb0bece7947/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773264662","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766830/79fd67f01c38187065bf0f1cebfab4999f02b2fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773264662","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766830/79fd67f01c38187065bf0f1cebfab4999f02b2fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773264662","categories":[{"description":"